    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74628" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁποτέρ-ωθε</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπότερ-θεν</span></b> , 
